The welcome scene coordinates now clamp using the rotated bounding box extent to eliminate stage overflow.

During entrance and exit animations, Z rotation enlarges a slot's axis-aligned bounding box by a spread factor of `|cos R| + |sin R|`. Computing the rotated half extent before applying the 8 px margin keeps bubbles inside the 1812 by 636 stage bounds at every angle. The clamping logic is updated in [welcome.js](file://$HOME/.claude/worktrees/mothers-love-tv-welcome/public/color-polish/scenes/welcome.js) and logged in [welcome.md](file://$HOME/.claude/worktrees/mothers-love-tv-welcome/docs/runs/2026-09-11-tv-scenes/lanes/welcome.md).

